          <_key>20fce09d-ffd6-49f5-b5ca-f4945136014a-en-h1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Multi-stream rotary nozzle for uniform coverage</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>20fce09d-ffd6-49f5-b5ca-f4945136014a-en-p1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>20fce09d-ffd6-49f5-b5ca-f4945136014a-en-p1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Rain Bird R-VAN-24</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>20fce09d-ffd6-49f5-b5ca-f4945136014a-en-p1s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text> is a multi-stream rotary nozzle designed to provide uniform lawn coverage. Its larger water droplets hold their trajectory better in light wind, while matched precipitation helps simplify irrigation-zone design.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
